.TH tine-page 1  "page " 
.SH NAME
tine\-page \- Read pages
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtine page\fR [\fB\-\-debug\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Read pages
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-debug\fR
Enable diagnostic logging for the desktop app
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
tine\-page\-show(1)
Show a page\*(Aqs outline (the text a window shows, unsaved edits included)
